ción en AWS Marketplace",{"_7897":13,"_22053":11,"_5":22208,"_18699":31722,"_15048":31723,"_1570":31724},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-22/despliegue/cloud#despliegue-en-aws-ec2--aws-marketplace","Despliegue en AWS EC2 – AWS Marketplace",{"_7897":14,"_22053":11,"_5":22208,"_18699":31726,"_15048":31727,"_1570":31728},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-22/despliegue/cloud#pasos","Pasos",{"_7897":15,"_22053":11,"_5":22208,"_18699":31730,"_15048":31731,"_1570":31732},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-22/despliegue/cloud#requisitos-de-infraestructura","Requisitos de infraestructura",{"_7897":16,"_22053":11,"_18699":31734,"_5":22203,"_15048":31723,"_1570":31735},[],"Lamassu IoT está disponible en **AWS Marketplace**, lo que permite lanzar una instancia preconfigurada en AWS EC2 con un único clic.",{"_7897":17,"_22053":11,"_18699":31737,"_5":22203,"_15048":31727,"_1570":31738},[],"Acceder a la página del producto de Lamassu IoT en AWS Marketplace",{"_7897":18,"_22053":11,"_18699":31740,"_5":22203,"_15048":31727,"_1570":31741},[],"Seleccionar el tipo de instancia recomendado (`t3.large` o superior)",{"_7897":19,"_22053":11,"_18699":31743,"_5":22203,"_15048":31727,"_1570":31744},[],"Configurar el grupo de seguridad: puertos `443`, `8443` y `9443`",{"_7897":20,"_22053":11,"_18699":31746,"_5":22203,"_15048":31727,"_1570":31747},[],"Lanzar la instancia y acceder a la consola de administración en `https://<ip-publica>`",{"_7897":21,"_22053":11,"_18699":31749,"_5":22203,"_15048":31731,"_1570":31750},[],"Instancia EC2 `t3.large` mínimo (recomendado `t3.xlarge`)",{"_7897":22,"_22053":11,"_18699":31752,"_5":22203,"_15048":31731,"_1570":31753},[],"EBS `gp3` de al menos 50 GB",{"_7897":23,"_22053":11,"_18699":31755,"_5":22203,"_15048":31731,"_1570":31756},[],"Security Group con acceso HTTPS desde los dispositivos IoT",{"_7897":24,"_22053":24,"_5":22198,"_1570":31715,"_22211":31758,"_18699":31759,"_15048":24},[31714,31715],[],{"_7897":25,"_22053":24,"_18699":31761,"_5":22203,"_15048":24,"_1570":31762},[],"Guía de